msgid "接入、控制、联网与交付可并行；共享合同先交接再改行为。每个功能增量同时交付实现、真实回归、当前文档和适用的完整门禁。软件、实板与发布分别关闭，不用提交数、计划生成或旧测试计数替代完成。"
msgstr "Integration, control, networking and delivery may proceed in parallel; hand off shared contracts before changing behavior. Each increment includes implementation, actual regressions, current documentation and applicable full gates. Close software, physical and publication exits separately, never replacing completion with commit counts, generated plans or old test totals."

msgid "通用机制进入平台，任务、协议寄存器表、Flash 分区、密钥、授权和恢复策略留外部工程。私有应用源码和证据不进入公开平台产物；参考系统的软件通过也不代表实板通过。"
msgstr "Reusable mechanisms belong in the platform; tasks, protocol register maps, Flash partitions, keys, authorization and recovery policy remain external. Private application source and evidence stay out of public platform artifacts; software success for a reference system does not establish physical success."

msgid "通用 DVFS、全设备 PM、userspace I/O、通用 TrustZone 异步传输和多种文件系统仍需独立需求与合同。Zephyr 可借鉴外部模块、设备模型、测试计划、Settings 与 PM 分层；代码复用前固定具体版本或提交，不把滚动文档作为实现身份。"
msgstr "General DVFS, all-device PM, userspace I/O, general asynchronous TrustZone transport and multiple filesystems still need independent requirements and contracts. Learn from Zephyr external modules, device models, test planning, Settings and PM layering; fix a version or commit before code reuse rather than using rolling documentation as implementation identity."

msgid "实板与后续测量的进入条件"
msgstr "Admission conditions for physical work and subsequent measurement"

msgid "实板接入后，先核对三块首发实际 Board、记录 PCB/晶振/供电/接线，建立 probe、serial 和 waveform/power-cut station。G474、H743、U575 来源参考配置另行核对实际板卡， H743 还需观察供电模式，U575 需在执行镜像前确认 option bytes 与启动状态。 先复核安全初值与 clock，再验证 UART 真 TC、取消、 RX 丢失、watchdog reset、Flash 掉电与 EXTI/PWM/ADC。每种 mode 只在实际执行过的 target tuple 上资格化。试验输出保持脱离产品负载，具体现场操作由 station 合同约束。"
msgstr "After equipment connection, first verify the three initial physical Boards and record PCB, oscillator, supply and wiring, then establish probe, serial and waveform/power-cut stations. Check actual G474, H743 and U575 reference boards separately; observe H743 supply mode and confirm U575 option bytes and boot state before running images. First check safe initial levels and clocks, then real UART TC, cancellation, RX loss, watchdog reset, Flash power cuts and EXTI/PWM/ADC. Qualify each mode only for the actually executed target tuple. Keep test outputs disconnected from product loads and follow station contracts for field operations."

msgid "按测量增加能力"
msgstr "Expand capabilities according to measurements"

msgid "下表保留原 71 个规划编号及其到 107 个权威任务的映射，不另建状态台账。 {download}`同一交付台账 <../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>`仍有 210 行，原 175 行 保持历史身份；35 个 `IT-` 行分别描述实现与当前开发检查。[派生视图](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md) 由原 renderer 生成，原编号、顺序和退出条件不变。"
msgstr "The tables preserve the original 71 planning IDs and their mapping to 107 authoritative tasks, without creating another status ledger. The {download}`same delivery ledger <../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>` still contains 210 rows: the original 175 retain their historical identities, and the 35 `IT-` rows separately describe implementation and current development checks. The [readable view](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md) is generated by the existing renderer; original IDs, order and exit conditions remain unchanged."

msgid "外置 provider、Settings、wait-select、可选观察、TMP117、熵、TLS、MQTT 和开发 工具已有有界实现。新增 RX 负载借用、MCUboot 控制、TX 错误观察、PCAP、resolver／ CLI 与 SDK v15 属于当前组合；实现、定向 GREEN、完整门禁和安装版 SDK 分别验收。 原测试源码路径是审查入口，不能代替新鲜执行 receipt。"
msgstr "External providers, Settings, wait-select, optional observation, TMP117, entropy, TLS, MQTT and developer tools have bounded implementations. RX payload loans, MCUboot control, TX error observation, PCAP, resolver/CLI refinements and SDK v15 belong to the current combination. Implementation, focused GREEN results, the complete gate and installed SDK are accepted separately. Test-source paths are review entry points and do not replace fresh execution receipts."

msgid "`IT-R04` 复用已有 H743 V／固定 HSI64／Cache off／裸机 SPI4 的生命周期 pause/resume，不规划新的通用 PM。它仍需当前集成执行与实板验收。`IT-S06` 的 已审调用方使用 Settings、显式 Flash region 和 MCUboot 字节存储，尚无文件语义 消费者；`IT-X04` 尚无新探针需求。因此暂不增加文件系统依赖或设备 runner， 真实需求出现后再按原退出条件进入。"
msgstr "`IT-R04` reuses the existing H743 V/fixed HSI64/Cache-off/baremetal SPI4 lifecycle pause/resume path; it does not plan a new generic PM system. Current integration execution and physical acceptance remain open. Reviewed `IT-S06` consumers use Settings, explicit Flash regions and MCUboot byte storage, with no file-oriented consumer yet. `IT-X04` has no new probe requirement. No filesystem dependency or device runner is added until a real requirement enters through the original exit conditions."

msgid "优先级：`P1–P2`。进入与顺序：R01/R02 复用现有观察与等待合同；R04 核对已有精确 H743 路径的集成、保留与恢复，不从公共类型推导通用 PM。"
msgstr "Priority: `P1–P2`. Entry and order: R01/R02 reuse existing observation and wait contracts. R04 checks integration, retention and recovery of the existing exact H743 path; public types do not imply generic PM."

msgid "本轮选定软件交付固定公共 P2 `ab532250`，完整两轮159、SDK v15、8 个候选／ 16 次 fresh 断网构建、P2 严格双语文档及无签名 outer 的公开实际恢复均已完成。 独立 QA 后续 `706ee80` 的普通完整索引门禁与完整 Python174 复扫通过：38 条 finding 为 30 note／6 warning／2 error，全部唯一对应原已审处置；七条旧 finding 消失且无新增。当前私有 E `f59debf1` 固定 P2 的 17 presets／ 116 命令、source／installed 各五个真实 C broker 场景、三个 recipes 和公共 SDK walk 均实际通过；E 已正常 nonforce push 并精确读回 `f59debf1`， 仓库保持 private、private main 未更新；后续 D／部署及最终 FF 仍待实际结果。已发布 `v0.2.1` 的 `b1b903da` 预览与 `7590b2d4` 历史候选保留原身份。精确源码、执行及 取得边界见{ref}`当前 P2 无签名软件交付 <p2-unsigned-software-ab532250>`。"
msgstr "Selected software delivery in this round is fixed to public P2 `ab532250`: two complete 159-stage runs, SDK v15, eight candidates / 16 fresh network-disabled builds, P2 strict bilingual documentation and actual public recovery of the unsigned outer archive have completed. Independent QA followup `706ee80` passed the ordinary complete-index gate and full Python174 analysis: all 38 findings, comprising 30 notes / 6 warnings / 2 errors, uniquely map to previously reviewed dispositions; seven old findings disappeared and none is new. Current private E `f59debf1` pins P2, with 17 presets / 116 commands, five real C broker scenarios each in source and installed builds, three recipes and the public SDK walk actually passed. E completed a normal nonforce push and exact readback of `f59debf1`; the repository remains private and private main is unchanged. Later D/deployment and final FF await actual results. The published `v0.2.1` preview at `b1b903da` and historical candidates at `7590b2d4` retain their original identities. See {ref}`current P2 unsigned software delivery <p2-unsigned-software-ab532250>` for exact source, execution and obtainability boundaries."

msgid "F01 当前159检查与原成本已对账；F07 完成同 P2／工具／环境的 observational 比较，缓存与 RSS 限制保留，不能称为受控因果提速。N09 的 fresh build directory／ warm configure-build 只证明选定 Native trace，其他 MCU、CLI 与 F05 退出仍独立。 继续开放 Flash／ECC event-owner／sticky／恢复细节、七组 vendor-leaf 提案、GD303 引用审查、物理开发入口、后续 D／部署／FF、 服务端规则和物理 HIL。测试保留须有原合同或独立等价覆盖依据，不能为通过而减项。"
msgstr "F01 reconciled current159 checks and their original costs. F07 completed an observational comparison on the same P2/tools/environment, retaining cache and RSS limitations without claiming controlled causal acceleration. N09 fresh-build-directory/warm configure-build observations establish only the selected Native trace; other MCU, CLI and F05 exits remain independent. Open work includes Flash/ECC event-owner/sticky/recovery details, seven vendor-leaf proposals, GD303 reference review, the physical developer path, later D/deployment/FF, server rules and physical HIL. Test retention decisions need original-contract or independent equivalent-coverage evidence; checks must not be removed to manufacture a pass."
